{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29073","headline":"访别韦隐居不值 · 许浑","name":"访别韦隐居不值","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"犬吠双岩碧树间，主人朝出半开关。\n汤师阁上留诗别，杜叟桥边载酒还。\n栎坞炭烟晴过岭，蓼村渔火夜移湾。\n故乡芜没兵戈後，凭向溪南买一山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29073.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29073","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}